title: "One subagent, from spawn to verdict"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: idle
    lg1: done
    lg2: stopped
    lg3: live
  }
  class lg0 tan
  class lg1 blue
  class lg2 orange
  class lg3 purple
  s0: Not started
  s1: Running
  s2: Finishing
  s3: Stopped, verdict pending
  s4: Finished, verdict delivered
  s5: Stopped, verdict delivered
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: a slot frees up and the agent starts
  s1 --> s2: the process exits
  s1 --> s3: you cancel it or pi shuts down while it runs
  s2 --> s4: its verdict is delivered [and it is dropped from the list] or its verdict is delivered
  s3 --> s5: its verdict is delivered [and it is dropped from the list] or its verdict is delivered
  class s0 tan
  class s1 purple
  class s2 purple
  class s3 orange
  class s4 blue
  class s5 orange
